   "title": "What this test changes",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Not a template: sorryhyun's moss_colorize_3k_v4 workflow rebuilt on ComfyUI's own loaders (MOSS Base int8, w4a8 text encoder, small VAE), because his loader wants his bf16 files. His Spectrum sampler does not accept ComfyUI's model, so a KSampler with the same sampler, steps and CFG runs instead, with layer 22 skipped on the negative. His Caption Helper needs packages that would not install here, so its output is typed into the prompt. With moss_colorize_3k_v4 at 1.0."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "As the i2i test, a further page. Caption: the helper's 'comic' layout (the page has no lettering, so no OCR lines). As shipped."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
